{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1540407-blood-snow-and-ash","id":1540407,"title":"Blood, Snow and Ash","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-14T18:45:53-07:00","id":1540407,"title":"Blood, Snow and Ash","content":"I got a reading of Requiem for Regina and decided to try updating the Mantle from the 3 Changeling courts. I will probably try to upgrade and create more contracts as well, but for now, here are the Mantles and one Royal Contract:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Blood</b><br /> <br /> Your character gains a Glamour point whenever they achieve recognition for their superiority or leadership.<br /> \u2022 Gain bonus dice equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots to mundane rolls to command someone or exhibit something.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Gain bonus dice equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots to mundane rolls to non-combat skills in a formal contest.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 When your character engages in Social Maneuvering, they reduce one additional Door per successful attempt.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Once per chapter spend a Glamour point to charm someone. They suffer the Swooned condition towards you.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Once per chapter, you may add your Mantle dots as additional doors at a Social Maneuvering against you.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Snow</b><br /> <br /> Your character gains a Glamour point whenever the hard work they put into something pays off.<br /> \u2022 Enemies suffer a penalty equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots on rolls to notice her when she\u2019s deliberately trying to blend into the mundane society.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Gain bonus dice equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots on mundane rolls to work.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Gain your Mantle dots as maximum additional rolls on Extended Actions.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 When someone tries to compel your character using supernatural means, you are instantly aware of the person responsible for the attempt, regardless if it was sucessfull or not.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 When affected by a condition that forces your character to act in a way contrary to one of her aspirations, spend a point of Willpower to resolve the condition.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Ash</b><br /> <br /> Your character gains a Glamour point whenever they protect an ally from being caught.<br /> \u2022 Gain bonus dice equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots to mundane rolls to steal something.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Enemies suffer a penalty equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots on rolls to chase her when she\u2019s fleeing from a mundane crime.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Gain bonus dice equal to your character\u2019s Mantle dots during mundane attempts to find food or shelter.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Whenever the changeling spends a point of Willpower to add dices to a roll, he uses the Mantle rating instead of the normal bonuses.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 At the ending of every scene, the changeling may chose to remove all physical evidences of his presence from the places he just went, including recordings.<br /> <br /> ------<br /> <br /> <b>Contracts of Inspiration (Blood)</b><br /> <br /> <b>Words of Inspiration (Royal)</b><br /> The changeling imbues her words with inspiration, and those who hear them recited are touched by her passion and intent.<br /> Cost: 2 Glamour<br /> Dice Pool: Manipulation + Expression + Mantle<br /> Action: 5 minutes<br /> <br /> Roll Results<br /> <br /> <b>Success: </b>The changeling writes her words carefully and imbues them with inspiration. As she speaks the words out loud, all listeners within (Mantle x 10 yards/meters) are affected by the Inspired condition. The changeling may choose to store the words for a later use in the same Chapter. Anyone reciting the original written words may confer the effects of the Contract.<br /> <br /> <b>Dramatic Failure:</b> The changeling fails to properly imbue Glamour into her words and the Wyrd lashes back on her mind, inflicting the Madness Condition.<br /> <b>Failure:</b> The Contract fails, and her words are not endowed with any particular influence.<br /> <b>Exceptional Success:</b> All who hear the words being recited also receive the Steadfast condition.<br /> <br /> <b>Loophole: </b>The changeling is imbuing her words in order to entertain an audience.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}